{"id":"b7d6bfa12e121880","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision.md","title":"Truth Decision for Letterless Bimodal Formulas","display":"cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision — Truth Decision for Letterless Bimodal Formulas","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision","aliases":["89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision"],"display":"cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision — Truth Decision for Letterless Bimodal Formulas","depends_on":["[[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]]","[[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","[[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision — Truth Decision for Letterless Bimodal Formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17034fdfe7fbba71\" href=\"?note=17034fdfe7fbba71\" title=\"89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form\">89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fcc108fa2ae7636\" href=\"?note=0fcc108fa2ae7636\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90426ebd1dd924ef\" href=\"?note=90426ebd1dd924ef\" title=\"89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness\">89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>；普通可证性与一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证性采用本书的标准谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 取无字母正规形定理的一个固定算法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 对 presentation 递归作布尔求值：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(\\bot)=0\">\\(\\nu(\\bot)=0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(h_\\alpha)=0\">\\(\\nu(h_\\alpha)=0\\)</span>（有限码），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(c_i)=0\">\\(\\nu(c_i)=0\\)</span>（有限指数），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(h_\\infty)=\\nu(c_\\infty)=1\">\\(\\nu(h_\\infty)=\\nu(c_\\infty)=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(\\neg e)=1-\\nu(e)\">\\(\\nu(\\neg e)=1-\\nu(e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(e\\land g)=\\nu(e)\\nu(g)\">\\(\\nu(e\\land g)=\\nu(e)\\nu(g)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}glb\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}truth\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu&amp;:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad\\nu(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\nu(h_\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O),\\quad\n\\nu(c_i)\\coloneqq0\\quad(i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}),\\\\\n\\nu(h_\\infty)&amp;=\\nu(c_\\infty)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\n\\nu(\\neg e)\\coloneqq1-\\nu(e),\\quad\\nu(e\\land g)\\coloneqq\\nu(e)\\nu(g),\\\\\nd_{\\mathsf{LL}}&amp;:\\mathsf{LL}_B\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad d_{\\mathsf{LL}}(A)\\coloneqq\\nu(f(A)),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(d_{\\mathsf{LL}}),\\\\\nd_{\\mathsf{LL}}(A)=1\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A))\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}glb\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}truth\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu&amp;:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad\\nu(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\nu(h_\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O),\\quad\n\\nu(c_i)\\coloneqq0\\quad(i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}),\\\\\n\\nu(h_\\infty)&amp;=\\nu(c_\\infty)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\n\\nu(\\neg e)\\coloneqq1-\\nu(e),\\quad\\nu(e\\land g)\\coloneqq\\nu(e)\\nu(g),\\\\\nd_{\\mathsf{LL}}&amp;:\\mathsf{LL}_B\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad d_{\\mathsf{LL}}(A)\\coloneqq\\nu(f(A)),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(d_{\\mathsf{LL}}),\\\\\nd_{\\mathsf{LL}}(A)=1\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A))\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.212–213、217。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>无字母公式的翻译与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无关。标准 PA 可靠性与一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则的保真性保证假句没有这两种证明；对迭代数和码长度归纳，全部有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i,D_\\alpha,H_\\alpha\">\\(C_i,D_\\alpha,H_\\alpha\\)</span> 的标准翻译为假。两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 生成元为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>，故其值为真。GLB 等价的算术可靠性保持这些真值，最终只须有限布尔求值。</p>\n<p>该算法判断“在标准算术下为真”，不把它等同于 GLB 定理性。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box_0\\bot\">\\(\\neg\\Box_0\\bot\\)</span> 的值为 1，但不是 GLB 定理：两个关系均为空的单点模型验证全部 GLB 公理与规则，而在其世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0\\bot\">\\(\\Box_0\\bot\\)</span> 真，故其否定假。GLSB 是对应的全部实现真值系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"17034fdfe7fbba71","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"0fcc108fa2ae7636","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"90426ebd1dd924ef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(\\bot)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(h_\\alpha)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(c_i)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(h_\\infty)=\\nu(c_\\infty)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(\\neg e)=1-\\nu(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(e\\land g)=\\nu(e)\\nu(g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}glb\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}truth\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu&:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad\\nu(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\nu(h_\\alpha)&\\coloneqq0\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O),\\quad\n\\nu(c_i)\\coloneqq0\\quad(i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}),\\\\\n\\nu(h_\\infty)&=\\nu(c_\\infty)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\n\\nu(\\neg e)\\coloneqq1-\\nu(e),\\quad\\nu(e\\land g)\\coloneqq\\nu(e)\\nu(g),\\\\\nd_{\\mathsf{LL}}&:\\mathsf{LL}_B\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad d_{\\mathsf{LL}}(A)\\coloneqq\\nu(f(A)),\\\\\n&\\operatorname{Comp}(d_{\\mathsf{LL}}),\\\\\nd_{\\mathsf{LL}}(A)=1\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A))\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"C_i,D_\\alpha,H_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box_0\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":2574,"backlinks":[{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]]、[[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]]、[[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正规化：[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]] → [[89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean]] → [[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]] → [[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]。算例：[[89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":["17034fdfe7fbba71","0fcc108fa2ae7636","0ce064881a79d6f7","90426ebd1dd924ef"]}